* Head to {p:Tenshodo} in {z:Lower Jeuno} and examine the Treasure Chest for your reward.
** The easiest way to repeat the fight to change your augmented item is to first toss it, then purchase the {@k} {k:Mega Bonanza Kupon} from {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} in {z:Port Jeuno} for 2,000 gil and 20 {i:Beastmen Seals|Beastmen's Seal|1126}.
